# About me

I am a computational linguist and postdoctoral researcher in the [CoAStaL NLP
group][] at University of Copenhagen, Denmark.  My research interests include
NLP for low-resource languages and non-standard varieties, computational
historical linguistics, and machine learning with a focus on neural networks and
multi-task learning.

Previously, I worked in various research projects related to [computational
historical linguistics][comphist] supervised by [Stefanie Dipper][].


